section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Avs40hZ5U2lWdqvZn4Zib10hSWSnE0GGbjdM83icPuEEpM7q5uZNGdvS1I8tIlsMBOKqCgGN7ic6E8OOrwUpNjz4w/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>分享、在看与点赞，至少我要拥有一个吧！</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"172cdab539b329a5b61a21580909905038048b8c0a37977861fb75af388dcea1","textLength":1698,"sourceSha256":"a58a24ad404075ddc84c230bcd151c11713bb86b5c99eb6b3e626234df655c34","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2b16ed7bf014a5052d91","title":"2026年中国疾病预防控制中心慢性非传染性疾病预防控制中心关于举办2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:06.196427+00:00"}
